---
// Animated five-point-stencil diffusion. Cell opacities are the real field
// values produced by the stencil in this page's Task 2, run for 32 steps
// from a hot centre block, sampled every 2 steps and gamma-corrected so
// the later, lower-amplitude frames stay visible.
//
// This figure animates unconditionally: the loop is the explanation, so it is
// deliberately not suppressed under prefers-reduced-motion.
---

